                "reply_count": 387,
                "retweet_count": 1293,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Under the One Big Beautiful Bill, we are putting Medicaid on a more sustainable fiscal trajectory and ensuring the program refocuses, as intended, towards serving the most vulnerable Americans.\n\nRecent polling shows that two-thirds of voters (66%) agree there is waste, fraud, and abuse in Medicaid that must be addressed. An even larger majority (72%) agree that able-bodied adults should demonstrate they are looking for a job or are employed to receive Medicaid benefits.\n\nThis bill will NOT reduce benefits for all those who Medicaid was intended to serve: the legal, eligible, and vulnerable.",
